{"about_the_game":"TWELVE MINUTES is a real-time top-down interactive thriller with an accessible click and drag interface. Featuring James McAvoy, Daisy Ridley, and Willem Dafoe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat should be a romantic evening with your wife turns into a nightmare when a police detective breaks into your home, accuses your wife of murder and beats you to death...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnly for you to find yourself immediately returned to the exact moment you opened the front door, stuck in a TWELVE-MINUTE time loop, doomed to relive the same terror again and again...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnless you can find a way to use the knowledge of what\u2019s coming to change the outcome and break the loop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTWELVE MINUTES blends the dream-like tension of THE SHINING with the claustrophobia of REAR WINDOW and the fragmented structure of MEMENTO.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"be32e1f573a3aff712ce90f617bed46c2feb2164.jpg","localized_name":"Continue","name":"Continue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097200/be32e1f573a3aff712ce90f617bed46c2feb2164.jpg"},{"icon":"5418709ba0162d0124ede637260c6e34b6dd5624.jpg","localized_name":"Mindfulness","name":"Mindfulness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097200/5418709ba0162d0124ede637260c6e34b6dd5624.jpg"},{"icon":"a14b21b1e1595b97065b19a57b4a3dbb9dc6a1f3.jpg","localized_name":"Alone","name":"Alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097200/a14b21b1e1595b97065b19a57b4a3dbb9dc6a1f3.jpg"},{"icon":"85d560ce9024f7f5d07d381a02f40fc16f6049f4.jpg","localized_name":"Confessed","name":"Confessed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1097200/85d560ce9024f7f5d07d381a02f40fc16f6049f4.jpg"},{"icon":"1245bd6ecc07f4cd06e922e701dd02f8d3eaf16e.jpg","localized_name":"Coward","name":"Coward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images